    "examples": [
      "0 of 371,818 Gsdme-perturbation rows had names == Gsdme.",
      "21 prespecified UPR or ER-proteostasis markers were tested in the Atl1 signatures; none had FDR<0.05. Hspa5 minimum nominal p=0.0849; Ddit3 minimum p=0.0444 with FDR=1.0; Xbp1 minimum p=0.0491 with FDR=1.0.",
      "Within the 21 Hk1-overlap cell types, Pfkm, Pgk1, and Gpi1 target transcripts were negative in 21/21 signatures each; target rows had FDR<0.05 in 6/21 Pfkm, 12/21 Pgk1, and 2/21 Gpi1 signatures, with median logFC -0.511, -1.052, and -0.406 respectively.",
      "1/17443 genes in the 155 MB Glut contrast had FDR<0.05 and that gene was Rusc2; the top non-target by FDR was Atp5b, logFC 0.3246, p=7.86e-6, FDR=0.0686; the next strongest negative non-target was Ggps1, logFC -0.4904, p=7.33e-5, FDR=0.4259.",
      "37 perturbed cells versus 7,679 controls; Nbea logFC -0.00277, nominal P=0.924, rank 12,124 of 17,012, FDR=1.0; nevertheless 8 genes had P<0.001 and 89 had P<0.01; Syp logFC -0.294, nominal P=0.00447, FDR=1.0.",
      "Full-genome Pearson scans in the three most suggestive Fosl2 classes gave weak non-self neighbors: in 054 CNU-MGE GABA, top r=0.111 and bottom r=-0.080; in 155 MB Glut, top r=0.067 and bottom r=-0.049; in 308 CB GABA, top r=0.236 and bottom r=-0.213."
    ]
